Semantropy's distribution build includes third-party software and Japanese
dictionary data under their respective licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
for the inventory. The generated distribution main.js also contains the
required license and notice texts so that they remain available in the
three-file Obsidian Community Plugin distribution.

The build embeds lindera-wasm 6.0.0 (MIT), its WebAssembly module, and a
Semantropy-compact build of the Lindera IPADIC 6.0.0 release archive, which
derives from mecab-ipadic-2.7.0-20070801. No dictionary is downloaded at
runtime.
